{"version":1,"url":"http://127.0.0.1:8765/tests/fixtures/agent-bad.html","title":"Trail Shop","grade":"F","percent":32,"passed":0,"scored":14,"is_shop":true,"checks":[{"id":"find_search","step":"Find","label":"Search has a results page at its own address","status":"fail","message":"Search works only inside the page. There is no results address an agent can open or come back to","why":"Agents search the way people do. A results page with its own address lets them search, compare and come back.","fix":"Put the search box in a form with method=\"get\" so results open at an address like /search?q=shoes."},{"id":"find_urls","step":"Find","label":"Every page has its own address","status":"fail","message":"3 links use #/ addresses that load the same page","why":"An agent opens and shares addresses. Addresses that start with #/ all load the same page, so the agent cannot go straight to a product or section.","fix":"Use real paths (/products/red-shoes) instead of #/ routes. Most frameworks have a history mode for this."},{"id":"read_names","step":"Read","label":"Every button and link has a name","status":"warn","message":"2 buttons have no name","why":"Agents that read the page find buttons and links by their names. A button with only an icon has no name, so for the agent it does not exist.","fix":"Give each icon-only button and link an aria-label, for example aria-label=\"Open cart\".","data":{"samples":["<button><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><path d=\"M0 0h16v16H0z\"></path></svg></button>","<button aria-label=\"\"></button>"]}},{"id":"read_unique","step":"Read","label":"Names are clear and unique","status":"warn","message":"3 different buttons are all called \"Save\"","why":"When several buttons have the same name, or links only say \"Read more\", the agent has to guess which one to use.","fix":"Make names specific: \"Save React Conf talk\", \"Read more about pricing\".","data":{"dup":[{"name":"Save","count":3}]}},{"id":"read_heading","step":"Read","label":"One main heading names the page","status":"warn","message":"2 main headings, so the topic is unclear","why":"One main heading tells the agent what the page is about. None or several make it guess.","fix":"Use exactly one <h1> that says what the page is about. Turn the others into <h2>."},{"id":"act_controls","step":"Act","label":"Clickable things are real buttons and links","status":"warn","message":"3 boxes react to clicks but are not buttons or links","why":"Agents click real buttons and links. A box that only looks clickable is a decoration to them.","fix":"Use <button> for actions and <a href> for navigation instead of clickable <div> or <span> elements.","data":{"samples":[{"text":"Trail Runner 2","html":"<div class=\"card\" onclick=\"x()\">Trail Runner 2</div>"},{"text":"Hiking Boot","html":"<div class=\"card\">Hiking Boot</div>"},{"text":"Sandal","html":"<div class=\"card\">Sandal</div>"}]}},{"id":"act_labels","step":"Forms","label":"Form fields have labels","status":"fail","message":"3 of 3 fields have no label (2 only have placeholder text)","why":"An agent fills a field by its label. Placeholder text disappears when you type and many agents do not read it.","fix":"Add a <label for> (or aria-label) to every field. Keep the placeholder only as an example.","data":{"fields":[{"tag":"input","type":"text","labeled":false,"placeholder":"Search products","autocomplete":"","kind":null,"name":"term","html":"<input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Search products\" name=\"term\">"},{"tag":"input","type":"text","labeled":false,"placeholder":"Your email","autocomplete":"","kind":"email","name":"email","html":"<input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Your email\" name=\"email\">"},{"tag":"input","type":"text","labeled":false,"placeholder":"","autocomplete":"","kind":"tel","name":"phone","html":"<input type=\"text\" name=\"phone\">"}]}},{"id":"act_autocomplete","step":"Forms","label":"Fields say what they want","status":"warn","message":"2 of 2 contact fields miss the type or autocomplete attribute","why":"The autocomplete and type attributes tell any agent what a field wants (email, phone, name), so it fills it right the first time.","fix":"Add the right type and autocomplete, for example type=\"email\" autocomplete=\"email\".","data":{"fields":[{"tag":"input","type":"text","labeled":false,"placeholder":"Your email","autocomplete":"","kind":"email","name":"email","html":"<input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Your email\" name=\"email\">"},{"tag":"input","type":"text","labeled":false,"placeholder":"","autocomplete":"","kind":"tel","name":"phone","html":"<input type=\"text\" name=\"phone\">"}]}},{"id":"popups","step":"Pop-ups","label":"Nothing covers the page when it loads","status":"fail","message":"A cookie banner covers the middle of the screen","why":"Agents that look at the screen cannot use what a banner or pop-up covers. Each extra pop-up is a step where the agent can get stuck.","fix":"Show at most one small banner at load, with a Close or Accept button that has a text name, and remember the choice.","data":{"overlays":[{"kind":"cookie","area":57,"coversCenter":true,"rect":{"x":0,"y":340,"w":1280,"h":460},"text":"We use cookies to improve your experience. ×","closeNamed":true,"closeUnnamed":false}]}},{"id":"motion","step":"Understand","label":"Content does not change by itself","status":"warn","message":"A slider changes by itself while the page is open","why":"Content that changes while the agent reads it gives it a different page each time it looks.","fix":"Stop sliders from changing by themselves, or pause them until the visitor presses Play."},{"id":"shop_price","step":"Shop","label":"Prices are text with a currency","status":"fail","message":"No price with a currency sign was found as text","why":"An agent reports the price to its user before buying. A price as text with a currency sign is the price it can trust.","fix":"Show each price as text with its currency, for example $129.00, not inside an image.","data":{"name":"Trail Runner 2","offer":{"price":"129.00","currency":null,"availability":null}}},{"id":"shop_offer","step":"Shop","label":"Product data has price, currency and stock","status":"warn","message":"Product data is missing currency, availability","why":"Product data in JSON-LD gives the name, price, currency and stock without reading the layout at all.","fix":"Add Product JSON-LD with an Offer that has price, priceCurrency and availability.","data":{"name":"Trail Runner 2","offer":{"price":"129.00","currency":null,"availability":null}}},{"id":"shop_stock","step":"Shop","label":"Stock is stated in words","status":"warn","message":"Stock is not stated in words","why":"\"In stock\" or \"Sold out\" in words tells the agent if it can buy. A colored dot does not.","fix":"Write the stock state in words next to the price: In stock, Only 2 left, Sold out."},{"id":"shop_cart","step":"Shop","label":"Add to cart is a named button","status":"warn","message":"No button named Add to cart or Buy now on this page","why":"The agent looks for a button named Add to cart or Buy now. An icon-only cart button is invisible to it.","fix":"Use a <button> with the text Add to cart (or aria-label=\"Add to cart\" on an icon button)."}],"tree":[{"role":"heading 1","name":"Trail Shop","depth":0,"flag":null},{"role":"heading 1","name":"New arrivals","depth":0,"flag":null},{"role":"button","name":"","depth":0,"flag":"noname"},{"role":"button","name":"","depth":0,"flag":"noname"},{"role":"link","name":"Shoes","depth":0,"flag":null},{"role":"link","name":"Socks","depth":0,"flag":null},{"role":"link","name":"Hats","depth":0,"flag":null},{"role":"button","name":"Save","depth":0,"flag":"dup"},{"role":"button","name":"Save","depth":0,"flag":"dup"},{"role":"button","name":"Save","depth":0,"flag":"dup"},{"role":"textbox","name":"","depth":0,"flag":"noname"},{"role":"textbox","name":"","depth":0,"flag":"noname"},{"role":"textbox","name":"","depth":0,"flag":"noname"},{"role":"button","name":"×","depth":0,"flag":null}],"overlays":[{"kind":"cookie","area":57,"coversCenter":true,"rect":{"x":0,"y":340,"w":1280,"h":460},"text":"We use cookies to improve your experience. ×","closeNamed":true,"closeUnnamed":false}],"viewport":{"w":1280,"h":800},"counts":{"buttons":6,"links":3,"fields":3,"unnamed":2},"status":200,"blocked":false,"screenshot":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","checked_at":"2026-11-28T14:47:23.393Z"}